  <ScriptNotes>
    <ScriptNote Color="#FFFFE0E07070" DateTime="2026-03-03T10:14:00Z" ID="1" Range="12,24" Writer="M. Osei-Lund">
      <Paragraph Type="General">
        <Text>Is the anchor too neat? Maybe the stamp is worn, half there.</Text>
      </Paragraph>
    </ScriptNote>
    <ScriptNote Color="#FFFFE0E07070" DateTime="2026-03-03T10:31:00Z" ID="2" Range="400,418" Writer="M. Osei-Lund">
      <Paragraph Type="General">
        <Text>Give Dov one more beat of wanting to go.</Text>
      </Paragraph>
    </ScriptNote>
  </ScriptNotes>

